Z||000004||FieroJoe||12-22-2001||09:47 PM||||I have been a 311 fan for many years now, and them and Incubus are my favorite bands.  I dont care what other people think, I just like the music for what it is.  Personally, I think the lyrics are very very clever.  Everybody's a critic anyways.  In my opinion, that editors favorite band may suck a lot. I have a lot of 311's albums, pretty much every single one:  Dammit, Unity, Hydroponic, Music, Grassroots, 311, Transistor, Live Album, Enlarged to Show Detail, All Doped Up Import, Omaha Sessions, and From Chaos.<P>As a matter of fact, I am listening to my favorite song on From Chaos right now, Uncalm.<P>I guess I am wierd about music.  I really don't have a favorite genre or anything, becuase I listen to a lot of classic rock too.  Sometimes I listen to pop, if there is nothing else on the radio.  I like radiohead, baroque classical piano music, and metallica.  Whatever is pleasing to my ears!||||reg||1
